# K13 (2026-09-27): the version on the Barline project page (pipeline version K13).
# NOT the default (current.argv is unchanged).  Recorded because until now it existed only as the
# argv inside each run's manifest.json (runs/t_beat/rK13full_*/manifest.json, generation_config),
# which this file reproduces flag for flag:
#   = t1_fix7.argv (T1 library and models)
#   + F11 (motif returns, the continuity and rhythm scorers, seam lead, source continuation by phrase)
#   + K13's three retrieval rules, each reading only the query song and the library:
#       --draft-step-lock-keep 0.3             footfall beat lock
#       --retrieval-selector-join-band 0.6     wider join pool (was 0.35)
#       --draft-energy-follow keep=0.3,...     intensity plan + on-beat settle
#
# usage (from the repo root):
#   python3 infer_atomic.py @configs/t_line/k13.argv --audio-dir <music npy dir> \
#       --sequence-list <list> --output-dir <new dir>
@configs/t_line/t1_fix7.argv
--draft-motif-return
0.15
--draft-motif-lags
4,2
--draft-motif-max
2
--draft-motif-pick
lively
--draft-continuity-scorer
/path/to/assets/runs/continuation_scorer/cont_v1_mask6_s0.pt
--draft-continuity-keep
0.75
--draft-rhythm-scorer
/path/to/assets/runs/rhythm_scorer/rhythm_scorer_v5_rhythm3_w128.pt
--draft-rhythm-keep
0.75
--draft-seam-lead
0.75
--draft-continue-source
/path/to/assets/runs/src_t_seg_beat4/segmentation.json
--draft-continue-lookahead
--draft-continue-any-label
--draft-continue-max-run
4
--draft-continue-phrase
4
--draft-continue-no-replay
--draft-step-lock-keep
0.3
--retrieval-selector-join-band
0.6
--draft-energy-follow
keep=0.3,smooth=2,metric=both,hit=0.3
